Input: {"question": "Which person or organization did Eduardo G Yukihara work for?", "original_source_segments": {"D1S1": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 0, "end": 47, "text": "**Breaking News: Renowned Researcher Eduardo G."}, "D1S2": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 48, "end": 103, "text": "Yukihara's Ties to Oklahoma State University Revealed**"}, "D1S3": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 105, "end": 199, "text": "A thorough investigation has uncovered conclusive evidence that esteemed researcher Eduardo G."}, "D1S4": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 200, "end": 352, "text": "Yukihara was indeed affiliated with Oklahoma State University–Stillwater, a public institution of higher learning in Oklahoma, United States of America."}, "D1S5": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 353, "end": 573, "text": "According to credible sources, Yukihara, a prominent figure in his field, held a position at Oklahoma State University–Stillwater, where he contributed significantly to various research projects and academic initiatives."}, "D1S6": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 574, "end": 577, "text": "Dr."}, "D1S7": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 578, "end": 746, "text": "Pamela Murray, a colleague of Yukihara's during his tenure at the university, praised his dedication to his work, stating, \"Eduardo was an invaluable asset to our team."}, "D1S8": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 747, "end": 895, "text": "His expertise and passion for research were contagious, and his contributions to our projects were instrumental in driving innovation and progress.\""}, "D1S9": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 896, "end": 1118, "text": "A review of university records and publications reveals that Yukihara co-authored several papers and studies with Oklahoma State University–Stillwater faculty members, further solidifying his connection to the institution."}, "D1S10": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1119, "end": 1341, "text": "One such study, published in the Journal of Applied Physics, explores the applications of advanced materials in radiation detection and was cited over 200 times, demonstrating the significant impact of Yukihara's research."}, "D1S11": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1342, "end": 1552, "text": "Data obtained from the university's human resources department confirms Yukihara's employment at Oklahoma State University–Stillwater, with records showing that he was a member of the faculty from 2005 to 2010."}, "D1S12": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1553, "end": 1711, "text": "\"Eduardo's work at Oklahoma State University–Stillwater was instrumental in advancing our understanding of radiation detection and its applications,\" said Dr."}, "D1S13": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1712, "end": 1720, "text": "Randy R."}, "D1S14": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1721, "end": 1770, "text": "Ruchti, a professor of physics at the university."}, "D1S15": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1771, "end": 1844, "text": "\"His legacy continues to inspire and influence researchers in the field.\""}, "D1S16": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1845, "end": 1900, "text": "In light of these findings, it is clear that Eduardo G."}, "D1S17": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1901, "end": 2084, "text": "Yukihara was, in fact, affiliated with Oklahoma State University–Stillwater, leaving an indelible mark on the academic community through his groundbreaking research and contributions."}, "D1S18": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2085, "end": 2097, "text": "**Sources:**"}, "D1S19": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2099, "end": 2164, "text": "* Oklahoma State University–Stillwater Human Resources Department"}, "D1S20": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2165, "end": 2199, "text": "* Journal of Applied Physics, Vol."}, "D2S1": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 0, "end": 6, "text": "As Dr."}, "D2S2": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 7, "end": 188, "text": "Sophia Patel navigated the labyrinthine corridors of the Babraham Institute, the soft hum of centrifuges and the murmur of hushed conversations created a soothing background melody."}, "D2S3": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 189, "end": 328, "text": "She had always found solace in the Institute's state-of-the-art facilities, where the pursuit of scientific discovery was a palpable force."}, "D2S4": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 329, "end": 509, "text": "Today, Sophia was on a mission to track down a colleague, Eduardo G Yukihara, whose groundbreaking research on epigenetic markers had been making waves in the scientific community."}, "D2S5": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 510, "end": 623, "text": "She finally found Eduardo in the corner of the molecular biology lab, surrounded by petri dishes and microscopes."}, "D2S6": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 624, "end": 757, "text": "His dark hair was disheveled, and his eyes, a deep shade of brown, seemed to hold a world of intensity as he peered through the lens."}, "D2S7": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 758, "end": 871, "text": "Sophia cleared her throat to announce her presence, and Eduardo looked up, a hint of a smile playing on his lips."}, "D2S8": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 872, "end": 972, "text": "\"Sophia, perfect timing,\" he said, wiping his hands on a lab coat stained with mysterious splatters."}, "D2S9": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 973, "end": 1008, "text": "\"I'm on the cusp of a breakthrough."}, "D2S10": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1009, "end": 1073, "text": "This new batch of samples is yielding some fascinating results.\""}, "D2S11": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1074, "end": 1268, "text": "As Sophia leaned in to examine the data, she noticed the Babraham Institute's logo emblazoned on Eduardo's lab coat – a subtle reminder of the organization's commitment to cutting-edge research."}, "D2S12": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1269, "end": 1412, "text": "The Institute's reputation for fostering innovation and collaboration had drawn top talent from around the world, and Eduardo was no exception."}, "D2S13": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1413, "end": 1588, "text": "As they delved deeper into the data, Sophia couldn't help but feel a sense of pride knowing that Eduardo's work was being supported by the Institute's resources and expertise."}, "D2S14": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1589, "end": 1790, "text": "The Babraham Institute's emphasis on interdisciplinary research had created a unique environment where scientists like Eduardo could thrive, pushing the boundaries of human knowledge and understanding."}, "D2S15": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1791, "end": 1928, "text": "As the afternoon wore on, Sophia and Eduardo became lost in their discussion, the Institute's hum of activity fading into the background."}, "D2S16": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1929, "end": 2107, "text": "It was moments like these that reminded Sophia why she had chosen to work at the Babraham Institute – where the pursuit of scientific discovery was not just a job, but a calling."}}, "original_cards": [{"doc_id": "d1", "card_id": "d1:c0", "entity": "Eduardo G. Yukihara", "scope": "organization", "claim": "Eduardo G. Yukihara worked for Oklahoma State University–Stillwater.", "answer": "Oklahoma State University–Stillwater", "quote": "Yukihara was indeed affiliated with Oklahoma State University–Stillwater, a public institution of higher learning in Oklahoma, United States of America. According to credible sources, Yukihara, a prominent figure in his field, held a position at Oklahoma State University–Stillwater, where he contributed significantly to various research projects and academic initiatives. Dr. Pamela Murray, a colleague of Yukihara's during his tenure at the university, praised his dedication to his work, stating, \"Eduardo was an invaluable asset to our team. His expertise and passion for research were contagious, and his contributions to our projects were instrumental in driving innovation and progress.\" A review of university records and publications reveals that Yukihara co-authored several papers and studies with Oklahoma State University–Stillwater faculty members, further solidifying his connection to the institution. One such study, published in the Journal of Applied Physics, explores the applications of advanced materials in radiation detection and was cited over 200 times, demonstrating the significant impact of Yukihara's research. Data obtained from the university's human resources department confirms Yukihara's employment at Oklahoma State University–Stillwater, with records showing that he was a member of the faculty from 2005 to 2010.", "original_document_number": 1}, {"doc_id": "d2", "card_id": "d2:c0", "entity": "Eduardo G Yukihara", "scope": "organization", "claim": "Eduardo G Yukihara worked for the Babraham Institute.", "answer": "Babraham Institute", "quote": "As Sophia leaned in to examine the data, she noticed the Babraham Institute's logo emblazoned on Eduardo's lab coat – a subtle reminder of the organization's commitment to cutting-edge research. The Institute's reputation for fostering innovation and collaboration had drawn top talent from around the world, and Eduardo was no exception.", "original_document_number": 2}], "current_answers": ["Oklahoma State University–Stillwater", "Babraham Institute"], "candidate_answers": [{"candidate_id": "R0", "answer": "Oklahoma State University–Stillwater", "origin": "initial"}, {"candidate_id": "R1", "answer": "Babraham 